ion before its comment's read-back, any write while its slot is HOLD, NONE or NO, any create, any call while `.tools/b1589/HOLD` exists, and **the 15th write (9 comments + 5 transitions = 14 at most)**. **Every JQL is `project = MPSCALC AND ( ... )` with the parentheses; every marker search is the phrase form `text ~ "\"REC-EVID-324-15NOV\""`**; GETs at no more than 4 per second, writes at least 3 seconds apart; paginate `GET /rest/api/3/search/jql` with `nextPageToken` until `isLast`. **The census:** `snap_before.json` (every key's status, comment count, summary and description hash; the issue count and the Done count) is taken BEFORE the first write, and the after-census is diffed against it.

